          "purpose": "Establish Main Slides vs Presentations, Slide ID vs Position, live vs pinned reuse, and Story layers.",
          "audience": "First-time visitors",
          "takeaway": "Slides are reused by reference, identified permanently, and carry their intent."
        },
        "pageIds": [
